# Task 2 corpus and full transcripts — licence-constrained, never published.
# The corpus is CC BY-NC-ND: publishing segment audio or a full transcript
# reproduces the work. What ships is metrics, short quoted error spans and the
# recipe (episode, URL, SHA-256, cut points), so the corpus is reproducible from
# the publisher's original rather than from our copy. Hashes of these files are
# published; the files are not.
